    "title": "Truth White Insight 828",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>The rear grip is set to be about 20mm longer than the Ocean Sprinter 838/8110, and it is also compatible with style belts that specialize in long-term fights with tuna. It is about 505mm from the reel foot center to the end.</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Recommended size Yellowfin tuna-100 kg</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>(It does not support places with fast tides such as Tappi Aomori and 100 kg class bluefin tuna. We will develop a dedicated model in the future.)</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Yellowfin tuna compatible models (reference)</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>~ 30 km OceanSprinter844 / 856 WhiteInsight828</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>~ 50 km OceanSprinter856 / 838/8110 WhiteInsight828 / 8010</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>50 kg ~ WhiteInsight828 / 8010/7210</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>(It does not mean that WI828 is stronger than OS838, but it is a guideline based on the balance between longer fight time and drag tension)</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">&middot;\tLength: 8ft2inch</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">&middot;\tWeight: 378g</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">&middot;\tTip Dia. / Butt Dia. : 2.8mm / 16mm</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">&middot;\tPe: 6-8</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">&middot;\tLure: 30～200g</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">&middot;\tPieces: Grip Joint</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">&middot;\tGuide: All Stainless PMNST16 / PMNSG16&times;2 / PMNSG20 / PMNSG25 / PMNSG30 / PMNSG40</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">&middot;\tSheet: DPS20LD UP</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">&middot;\tGrip: EVA</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">&middot;\tCompatible Reel: Shimano 14000, 18000 &amp; Daiwa 5500, 6000, 7500</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Made In Japan</p>",
